===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|hypnoses}}

# A [[trancelike]] state, [[artificial]]ly [[induce]]d, in which a person has a [[heighten]]ed [[suggestible|suggestibility]], and in which [[suppress]]ed [[memory|memories]] may be [[experience]]d.
# The art or skill of [[hypnotism]].

